  {
    "id": "f2dd9ade-3b2d-5120-96b1-40dfe2385fd4",
    "pack": "season-of-ghosts",
    "kind": "spell",
    "slug": "spell:entangle-fate",
    "name": "Entangle Fate",
    "level": 4,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["concentrate", "manipulate", "mental"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "season-of-ghosts",
        "page": 308,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=2541"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You cause a swirl of energy to entangle the fates of all caught within the blast. Each creature in the area must attempt a Will save."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The creature is unaffected."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The creature's fate becomes distorted, and momentary conflicting glimpses of the immediate future cause the creature to become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "071324e5-bb4c-5ed2-9e2f-28185b65ded7"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " until the start of its next turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As success, but the creature is off-guard for the duration of the spell. If more than one of the targets failed to resist this spell, the creature also becomes "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9e1dad43-36fe-5629-923f-2df63c12d90f",
            "label": "Stupefied 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for the duration of the spell as its fate and those of the other creatures continue to clash and strain against each other."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As failure, but any creature that becomes stupefied 1 for the duration of the spell also becomes "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5aa15fa8-99a7-56a4-8237-f605177275dd",
            "label": "Enfeebled 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "69f88e3c-d871-5fb9-82c6-120348a7c0e8",
            "label": "Clumsy 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for the spell's duration."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
