          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The golden light of a new dawn and the promise of life beyond death radiates from your body. You radiate bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) and gain mental resistance 5. Any nindoru fiend or undead that begins its turn adjacent to you must attempt a Will save with the following results."
          }
